        "title": "Link a purpose to an action",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "The first phrase gives the purpose; the later action serves it. The linking word is common in formal explanations, and does not add a second purpose.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "我们为了学习而读书。",
                "pinyin": "wǒmen wèile xuéxí ér dúshū 。",
                "meaning": "We read for the purpose of learning.",
